                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9d3112d7-e8b6-34c7-b054-8b5ce14ff644",
                        "entry_id": "ed885eee-f5a7-3d53-b484-7ce1fed75c9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "karakteristieke eigenschap"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "641fc7a2-7e64-4034-83af-376477e13a06",
                                "sense_id": "9d3112d7-e8b6-34c7-b054-8b5ce14ff644",
                                "text": "Hij noemt Boer \"een grootheid van wie ik het meest heb kunnen leren\". Van de Laar: \"Zijn belangrijkste kenmerk was zijn liefde voor natuur. Daar haalde hij energie en voldoening uit en dat liet hij terugzien op het bord.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0276d554-7cc9-4655-88cd-1b5cc504140c",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed885eee-f5a7-3d53-b484-7ce1fed75c9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d3112d7-e8b6-34c7-b054-8b5ce14ff644",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kennzeichen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kennzeichen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8e5e9ab-d836-384e-ad93-127410a59209",
                                        "entry_id": "2e68f2cb-56e3-3487-809a-f74057efd109",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Merkmal, an dem man eine Person oder einen Gegenstand erkennt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "general"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef8696a2-dc22-4e8f-ac0d-3060ceeab3b3",
                                                "sense_id": "a8e5e9ab-d836-384e-ad93-127410a59209",
                                                "text": "Ein besonderes Kennzeichen des Täters ist eine Narbe über dem rechten Auge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eef51ee6-fe27-4238-808b-874d8a22dd49",
                                                "sense_id": "a8e5e9ab-d836-384e-ad93-127410a59209",
                                                "text": "„An diesem Herbsttage war alles still in Skálholt, und niemand wußte, daß etwas geschehen; es begann zu frieren, und dadurch roch es nicht mehr so arg nach Kehricht und Schmutz, was sonst ein Kennzeichen dieses Ortes war.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15e531c9-9070-3adc-95b9-dcb9d0eb0323",
                                        "entry_id": "2e68f2cb-56e3-3487-809a-f74057efd109",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zulassungsnummer oder Kennung eines Fahrzeugs"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Verkehrswesen"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73bf1522-d1ef-47eb-bf1a-77ab1d335a5e",
                                                "sense_id": "15e531c9-9070-3adc-95b9-dcb9d0eb0323",
                                                "text": "Der Wagen hatte ein Koblenzer Kennzeichen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5994f2f-f835-4874-b1ff-2ff0b978c0b8",
                                                "sense_id": "15e531c9-9070-3adc-95b9-dcb9d0eb0323",
                                                "text": "„Wir hatten den Wagen im unteren Deck der Fähre geparkt, irgendwo in der Mitte zwischen lauter Fahrzeugen, die britische Kennzeichen trugen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98e63168-f017-4a7f-b78d-c97b8e968363",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed885eee-f5a7-3d53-b484-7ce1fed75c9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d3112d7-e8b6-34c7-b054-8b5ce14ff644",
                        "target_lang_word": "distinguishing mark",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0ef01d9-64ef-4f73-8e35-22192abf295a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed885eee-f5a7-3d53-b484-7ce1fed75c9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d3112d7-e8b6-34c7-b054-8b5ce14ff644",
                        "target_lang_word": "trait",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trait",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c34df191-bbe7-3de8-a2b1-2d8e475cdc0b",
                                        "entry_id": "35fc7253-7622-37c9-a5d3-fb986e15e40d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An identifying characteristic, habit or trend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b398ce5-34cd-4246-b6f2-598f4c64e14c",
                                                "sense_id": "c34df191-bbe7-3de8-a2b1-2d8e475cdc0b",
                                                "text": "inherited traits and acquired traits"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8fe265b-1cc8-4e62-834a-e848ddf8351f",
                                                "sense_id": "c34df191-bbe7-3de8-a2b1-2d8e475cdc0b",
                                                "text": "The number one personality trait I hate is hypocrisy. Why can't you be consistent!?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a41621e1-4294-4554-8c71-23c423b7c35c",
                                                "sense_id": "c34df191-bbe7-3de8-a2b1-2d8e475cdc0b",
                                                "text": "The English, of all classes, value themselves on this trait, as distinguishing them from the French, who, in the popular belief, are more polite than true."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dcf6cb2-5228-4940-a220-15bdb54c83ea",
                                                "sense_id": "c34df191-bbe7-3de8-a2b1-2d8e475cdc0b",
                                                "text": "The positive and constructive aspect of possibility gives the key to understanding the two chief traits of immaturity, dependence and plasticity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04a6c9b2-9b0a-4ee8-ade6-9584674e2d70",
                                                "sense_id": "c34df191-bbe7-3de8-a2b1-2d8e475cdc0b",
                                                "text": "Turning to our second trait, if you have straight hair, then both of your parents must carry an allele for this trait."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32e7a74e-ce6b-3319-9d64-f38cb3b21781",
                                        "entry_id": "35fc7253-7622-37c9-a5d3-fb986e15e40d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An uninstantiable collection of methods that provides functionality to a class by using the class’s own interface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d384d839-b628-43b6-a7c9-77d6a376e675",
                                                "sense_id": "32e7a74e-ce6b-3319-9d64-f38cb3b21781",
                                                "text": "Traits are somewhat between an interface and a mixin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "672f8ea4-005a-4a09-8779-ed652215722a",
                                                "sense_id": "32e7a74e-ce6b-3319-9d64-f38cb3b21781",
                                                "text": "Traits are parametrized on other methods, which must be provided to create a class using the trait. Using a trait-like mechanism to compose large collections of mutually-dependent classes or traits could lead to parameter explosion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ccd67ff-137c-447d-bd10-e1c8f21eec56",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed885eee-f5a7-3d53-b484-7ce1fed75c9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d3112d7-e8b6-34c7-b054-8b5ce14ff644",
                        "target_lang_word": "signe distinctif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "signe distinctif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74c5da91-5259-33bc-bfff-8fc277e68611",
                                        "entry_id": "16a0fc37-3ced-3ac9-923f-b61d0b8315b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Signe (marque ou geste) permettant de distinguer ou identifier quelque chose ou quelqu’un."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "661c6afb-3bc9-43c7-aa10-812851d84bff",
                                                "sense_id": "74c5da91-5259-33bc-bfff-8fc277e68611",
                                                "text": "L’art. 66 du „Protocole additionnel aux Conventions de Genève du 12 août 1949 relatif à la protection des victimes des conflits armés internationaux“ (Protocole I) définit le signe distinctif international de la protection civile, un „triangle équilatéral bleu sur fond orange quand il est utilisé pour la protection des organismes de protection civile, de leurs bâtiments, de leur personnel et de leur matériel ou pour la protection des abris civils“."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd319e9f-2264-3a3b-b372-b7c0ccf0da46",
                                        "entry_id": "16a0fc37-3ced-3ac9-923f-b61d0b8315b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Signe, logo, nom, slogan, etc. protégé en tant que marque commerciale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89bfb97d-5c43-4b76-bea9-cae65dbf8d54",
                                                "sense_id": "dd319e9f-2264-3a3b-b372-b7c0ccf0da46",
                                                "text": "Lorsque plusieurs entreprises ou particuliers souhaitent utiliser un signe identique ou similaire, il existe un risque de conflits. Cette fiche informative donne un aperçu des différents signes distinctifs et fournit quelques indications permettant de déterminer quel droit l’emporte sur l’autre en cas de conflit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
